  <categoryEntries>
    <categoryEntry name="Adeptus Custodes" id="6d79-7c6b-e6cb-eec8" hidden="false">
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Teleport Strike" id="cf85-81ba-c8a7-82fd" hidden="false" targetId="6301-eaed-f948-13b8" type="profile"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Aegis of the Emperor" id="0f88-5850-dbe9-0dff" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Models with this ability have a 4+ invulnerable save.
- Each time a model with this ability would lose a Wound, roll one D6: on a 6+, that Wound is not lost.
- Each time a model with this ability would lose a Wound as a result of a Mortal Wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that Wound is not lost. If the Mortal Wound is inflicted during a Psychic phase, add 1 to the roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Peerless training" id="c668-d3d2-a544-6ffc" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Models with this ability can ignore any or all Hit roll modifiers.
- Add 1 to the Hit roll for attacks made by models with this ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Aegis of the Emperor" id="d828-7e96-6850-d425" hidden="true" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this ability would lose a Wound, roll one D6: on a 6+, that Wound is not lost.
- Each time a model with this ability would lose a Wound as a result of a Mortal Wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that Wound is not lost. If the Mortal Wound is inflicted during a Psychic phase, add 1 to the roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Martial Ka’tah" id="7904-ce5d-cd03-1fb4" hidden="true">
          <description>During your Command phase, you can select one of the three of the following abilities, that affect every ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit from your army until your next Command phase:
- Calistus: Each time a INFANTRY or BIKER unit makes a Normal Move or Advances in your Movement phase, in your following Shooting phase, it counts as having Remained Stationary.
- Conservai: Units can perform an action in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back. In addition, while a unit is performing an action, it can shoot without that action failing.
- Salvus: Add 1 to the number of Attacks of each ranged weapon a INFANTRY model has equipped.

At the beginning of each Fight phase, you can select one of the three of the following abilities, that affect every ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit from your army until the next Fighting phase:
- Datacari: Until that Fight phase is resolved, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of models with this ability.
- Rendax: Each time a model with this ability makes an attack against a VEHICLE or MONSTER unit, an unmodified hit roll of 6 automatically wounds the target.
- Kaptaris: Each time a melee attack is made against this unit, the hit roll cannot be re-rolled.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Peerless training" id="166d-4b3d-fd6f-c4a3" hidden="false">
          <description>When a unit from Adeptus Custodes fires Overwatch or Searching for Targets, it scores a hit on a unmodified roll of 4+ instead of a 6.
If the unit has the INFANTRY Keyword and is in a terrain with the DEFENSIBLE trait, it scores a hit on a unmodified roll of 3+.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </categoryEntry>
