          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this unit is set up in the Battlefield by the Teleport Strike ability, you can, at the end of the movement phase the unit has deployed, split up the unit.
